Package: livenx-si-findings-export
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), passwd
Maintainer: LiveAction Integrations <noreply@liveaction.com>
Description: Export LiveNX Security Insight findings to a JSON Lines file
 Runs a systemd service that continuously reads LiveNX Security Insight
 findings (the si_findings table) through the LiveNX REST API and appends
 them to a JSON Lines file under /data. It can run on any Debian or Ubuntu
 host that reaches LiveNX on port 443, or on the LiveNX server itself.
 .
 Everything is installed under /var, /etc and /data, the locations LiveNX
 keeps across reboots, so the service survives a restart of the appliance.
